        "committer": {
          "name": "Ronnie Sahlberg",
          "email": "rsahlberg@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-11-15 00:16:15.000000000",
          "tz": 600
        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit tests for lod_dev.c helpers",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit tests for lod_dev.c helpers\n\nlod_dev.c, which handles LOD device/stack setup and configuration\nparsing, had no kunit coverage.  Most of its code needs a live device\nstack to exercise, but two small helpers are pure (or nearly pure)\nfunctions that can be tested in isolation: lodname2mdt_index(), which\nparses the MDT index out of an LOD device name, and lod_statfs_sum(),\nwhich accumulates one target's obd_statfs into a running total,\nrescaling for differing block sizes.\n\nAdd lustre/kunit/lod_dev_test.c with 6 test cases covering both\nfunctions: lodname2mdt_index() for the pre-1.9 no-\"-MDT\" case, a\nwell-formed name, and malformed suffixes; lod_statfs_sum() for the\nsame-block-size case and both directions of block-size rescaling.\n\nUn-staticize lod_statfs_sum() and export it (lodname2mdt_index() was\nalready exported) so the test module can call it directly.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: Ief430f2d5a475bbd2006a685e7a73edd9df5d5d1\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
